msgctxt "#32212"
msgid "Shows you are rewatching on Trakt match your rewatch progress in Kodi. Episodes watched since the rewatch started are marked watched, and the rest unwatched. Start a rewatch from a show's context menu or on Trakt."
msgstr "In Kodi, meaitseálann na seónna a bhfuil tú ag athbhreathnú orthu ar Trakt do dhul chun cinn athbhreathnaithe. Marcáiltear na heipeasóidí a féachadh ó thosaigh an t-athbhreathnú mar féachta, agus an chuid eile mar neamhfhéachta. Tosaigh athbhreathnú ó roghchlár comhthéacs seó nó ar Trakt."

msgctxt "#32213"
msgid "Movie sync"
msgstr "Sioncrónú scannán"

msgctxt "#32214"
