msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Tá an breiseán Trakt cumasaithe freisin. Déanann an dá bhreiseán scrobáil agus sioncrónú le Trakt, mar sin déantar gach rud faoi dhó."

