msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "An dtosófar athbhreathnú ar Trakt? Tosóidh do dhul chun cinn arís, agus marcálfar gach eipeasóid mar neamhfhéachta in Kodi."

msgctxt "#32222"
