msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir athbhreathnú a thosú"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Úsáid an téama OG Trakt"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Taispeánann sé lógó dearg Trakt, na croíthe agus na dathanna aibhsithe, mar atá ar og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir %i a shioncrónú"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Tá do chuntas Trakt faoi ghlas. Déan teagmháil le tacaíocht Trakt."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Tá teorainn an liosta faire sroichte: %i"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Roghnaigh cad atá le sioncrónú"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Oscail an socrú sioncrónaithe a thaispeántar tar éis ceangal le Trakt."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Sioncrónaigh nuair a chríochnaíonn Kodi scanadh nó glanadh leabharlainne. Seachas sin, ní ritheann sioncrónú ach nuair a thosaíonn tú féin é, mar shampla ón roghchlár comhthéacs."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Tabhair fógra nuair a thosaíonn agus a chríochnaíonn sioncrónú tar éis scanadh nó glanadh leabharlainne."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Ná taispeáin aon fhógraí sioncrónaithe fad is atá físeán á sheinm."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Meaitseáil míreanna gan aitheantas IMDb, TMDB ná TVDB de réir teidil agus bliana, le linn scrobála agus sioncrónaithe. Ní úsáidtear riamh é chun míreanna a mharcáil mar neamhfhéachta ná chun rátálacha a ghlanadh."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Stádas féachta"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Trakt go Kodi: meaitseálann Kodi Trakt, líon na seinmeanna agus na dátaí san áireamh, agus marcáiltear aon rud gan seinm ar Trakt mar neamhfhéachta. Kodi go Trakt: cuirtear míreanna a féachadh orthu in Kodi gan seinm ar Trakt le stair Trakt. An dá bhealach: faigheann gach taobh na seinmeanna atá in easnamh air, agus ní mharcáiltear aon rud mar neamhfhéachta lasmuigh d'athbhreathnú Trakt."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "As"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Trakt go Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Kodi go Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "An dá bhealach"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Rátálacha"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Scannáin, seónna agus eipeasóidí"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Trakt go Kodi: meaitseálann Kodi Trakt, agus glantar in Kodi na rátálacha nach bhfuil ag Trakt. Kodi go Trakt: cuirtear rátálacha Kodi le Trakt, in ionad cinn atá difriúil. An dá bhealach: cóipeáiltear rátálacha atá in easnamh i ngach treo, agus nuair atá siad difriúil coinnítear rátáil Trakt."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Pointí atosaithe ó Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Atosaíonn Kodi san áit a bhfuil an mhír curtha ar sos ag Trakt, mar shampla ó ghléas eile. Seolann athsheinm in Kodi a dhul chun cinn chuig Trakt fós nuair atá sé seo as."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Cur leis"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Cur leis agus baint"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Cur leis: cuirtear míreanna Kodi le bailiúchán Trakt. Cur leis agus baint: baintear as freisin míreanna bailithe nach bhfuil ag Kodi, iad siúd ó ghléasanna nó aipeanna eile san áireamh."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Déanann Relay scrobáil i gcónaí nuair atá sé ceangailte. Láimhseálann an sioncrónú an méid nár scrobáil sé: gléasanna eile, stair níos sine."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Ar siúl"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "Ní shioncrónaítear stádas féachta."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Meaitseálann Kodi Trakt, líon na seinmeanna agus na dátaí san áireamh. Marcáiltear aon rud gan seinm ar Trakt mar neamhfhéachta in Kodi."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Cuirtear míreanna a féachadh orthu in Kodi gan seinm ar Trakt le stair Trakt. Ní athraítear Kodi."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Faigheann gach taobh na seinmeanna atá in easnamh air, agus ní mharcáiltear aon rud mar neamhfhéachta lasmuigh d'athbhreathnú Trakt."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Ní shioncrónaítear rátálacha."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Meaitseálann rátálacha Kodi Trakt, agus glantar in Kodi na rátálacha nach bhfuil ag Trakt."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Cuirtear rátálacha Kodi le Trakt, in ionad cinn atá difriúil. Ní athraítear Kodi."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Cóipeáiltear rátálacha atá in easnamh i ngach treo. Nuair atá siad difriúil, coinnítear rátáil Trakt."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Coinníonn Kodi a phointí atosaithe féin."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Atosaíonn Kodi san áit a bhfuil an mhír curtha ar sos ag Trakt, mar shampla ó ghléas eile."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Ní ritheann sioncrónú ach nuair a thosaíonn tú féin é, mar shampla ón roghchlár comhthéacs."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Sioncrónaigh nuair a chríochnaíonn Kodi scanadh nó glanadh leabharlainne."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Sábháil agus sioncrónaigh"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i movies in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "An marcálfar %i scannán mar neamhfhéachta in Kodi chun Trakt a mheaitseáil?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i movie ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "An nglanfar rátálacha %i scannán in Kodi chun Trakt a mheaitseáil?"

msgctxt "#32266"
msgid "Unwatch %i episodes in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "An marcálfar %i eipeasóid mar neamhfhéachta in Kodi chun Trakt a mheaitseáil?"

msgctxt "#32267"
msgid "Clear %i show ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "An nglanfar rátálacha %i seó in Kodi chun Trakt a mheaitseáil?"

msgctxt "#32268"
msgid "Clear %i episode ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "An nglanfar rátálacha %i eipeasóid in Kodi chun Trakt a mheaitseáil?"
